# NextFinUp production crontab — source of truth for the server's cron jobs.
#
# The live crontab on the server can drift from this file if someone edits it directly with
# `crontab -e`. After changing this file, apply it on the server with:
#   crontab deploy/crontab
# and after editing on the server, sync it back here with:
#   crontab -l > deploy/crontab
#
# Read-only view of whatever is currently live: /admin-tools/cron/ (articles.views.cron_status_view).

